{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林結婚10周年驚談「分居」  郭可頌一口應承：點解要咁負面？  兩女學業觸發婚姻危機\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40cef68594c41e20da57210e24871050/2026-11/20261031_ENT__.png\"/>\n<p>46歲的名模熊黛林與「百億塑膠廠大王」郭達昌之子、郭可盈弟弟郭可頌結婚10周年，兩公婆近日在慶祝期間竟無預警驚談「分居」。熊黛林與郭可頌於2016年拉埋天窗，婚後誕下一對雙胞胎女兒，一家四口向來樂也融融。熊黛林婚後曾一度淡出幕前做全職豪門少奶奶，近年則積極復出，頻頻接拍綜藝兼做直播帶貨。日前二人趁結婚10周年展開浪漫之旅享受二人世界，豈料在車廂溫馨談心期間，卻因一對女兒未來的升學問題突然觸發「分居」話題，令熊黛林當場睜大雙眼表示驚訝。</p>\n<h2>熊黛林因女兒讀書問題疑「分居」</h2>\n<p>郭可頌近日精心策劃了自駕遊北上之旅哄愛妻開心，出發時已貼心準備了一大袋零食及飲品，又邊駕車邊高唱林子祥的經典情歌《分分鐘需要你》，哄得熊黛林笑逐顏開，冧爆直呼：「這種好日子已經過了10年啦！」其後兩人食完飯繼續行程，期間不免談起兩個寶貝女。熊黛林主動向老公提議，指如果將來女兒出外讀書：「你去照顧佢哋囉，我就喺呢度，好冇呀？」郭可頌聽後一口應允，直言：「我都冇所謂呀！我可以睇佢哋讀書都好開心。」熊黛林隨即追問：「我唔使去呀？」郭可頌表示夫妻倆屆時可以不時互相探望。</p>\n<img alt=\"郭可頌百億家族背景顯赫，其已故父親郭達昌是香港知名「塑膠大王」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85b70c1150552c8237fb8ad03969e718/2026-08/4ab8a22cgy1fxmxo3xbhzj20sg0lctc8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林早前為郭可頌慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da33ef04bb04dbce2216a1b3f568359d/2026-08/lynnx1010_1786417823_3961081839645240078_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia完全唔似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30f5f9e11c5fd50a1d8e2e67b36acfd1/2026-08/lynnx1010_1786417823_3961081837707406420_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林收到鮮花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7abceb8860897a4064f3dd0d8168593/2026-10/LYNN_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a6516eeaa3a8fbcc278dc0a7c6d05f1/2026-10/LYNN_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林獲老公及一對孖女慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ca1dc7be01cd29acae39bdce6857a91/2026-10/LYNN_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林每年生日都會跟老公放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac3111bd9c9385814c08d6ace7d6da75/2025-10/LYNN_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林每年生日都晒全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e61b70d3e92e411cc839aaafa98b6f6/2025-10/LYNN_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後非常幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01464873ca2b70a3bb1aa01647709704/2024-10/Lynn_136_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚姻生活美滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6192e2c29d118d9593acaff0b33b8dfe/2024-10/Lynn_138_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公拍拖食早餐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8f269983cdedb6ffb69b67588f4bc2f/2025-03/LYNN_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公慶祝結婚8周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8b5119f15f47cb2b6f7330838fddea0a/2024-10/Lynn_137_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林慶祝結婚9周年紀念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d51cafe350a3a6a0b64b11c72e3cb84e/2025-10/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林老公郭可頌上載合照，慶祝結婚9周年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9278d69f49247c310838ea1e2643dea3/2025-10/LYNN_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林2018年誕下一對異卵雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7367977cea77dcd3c4ae572a558382d7/2023-03/LYNN_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林2018年誕下異卵雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2de2bbbf4e7e21793d09b694a02b3d06/2023-03/LYNN_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林為兩個寶貝女舉行百日宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c0f41ccead8b31f7ffff402d5ca9fb7/2023-03/LYNN_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾經帶兩女，陪老公及奶奶遊日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ea0a899d12dc7984aa888ecda5b83b1/2023-06/Lynn%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林與老公郭可頌早前帶一對囡囡遊加拿大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12b736cf0e66668e8276ccbc06b3e167/2024-07/lynn_193_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>郭可頌冧招化解婚姻危機</h2>\n<p>熊黛林對於為照顧女兒要分隔兩地，聽後即睜大眼睛驚訝反問：「咁我哋咪分居囉？」郭可頌隨即反問：「點解要咁負面？」熊黛林則解釋道：「久唔久見一面咪叫分居囉！」眼見愛妻緊張，郭可頌隨即一手緊拖住老婆的手給予安心，深情哄道：「揸住咪唔會分，咁妳陪我去。」簡單一句話瞬間化解「分居危機」，不少網民看過片段後，紛紛大讚郭可頌既顧家又寵妻。</p>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林已經46歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d4c408314fc3be94ca3a7f0e062002d/2023-03/LYNN_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後減少幕前演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3875335b50bd3304b98a2951890d54a7/2024-06/LYNN_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後仍繼續工作，未有做全職少奶奶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4524dea9e00505093bfc734b0e10f9c1/2025-10/LYNN_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林家庭事業兩不誤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2781f2f0511e94d99012b35cd4a2ff2/2023-08/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林獲不少廣告商垂青。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/640011fe5ac69c16e63fb21d6465b48d/2023-10/lynnx1010_1689305130_3146441948139526181_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾指內衣廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81bcab92090040ba50a42c3ec3799936/2024-05/lynn_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"駐顏有術的熊黛林身材Fit爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff9bdb109da9b6c3080d0ceed0d591fb/2023-03/LYNN_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林上圍豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ead7770aa84d4ee0a64902fa5f04281/2023-03/001sahxlgy1h5k4fj011rj62002nz7uu02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林已是兩女之母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91f494a5dd6dfb178a7ee2752531e898/2023-03/001sahxlgy1h5k4fhbgnvj61p329g7wh02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林擁有一雙長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b596d002fe82193578c86031b0543d7/2023-03/LYNN_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林對胸部保養有學問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ce735475e12d6f572ba89e436bac238/2024-05/lynn_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾大談胸部下垂問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81f58e800e124d6f00d413b2f0120478/2023-03/LYNN_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林婚後逐漸減少性感打扮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1996e9ff2b9ff7bd459f2f15e6f24600/2023-10/0909_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"模特兒出身的熊黛林身材出眾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e479e02337d472de356b69083c5435ec/2023-10/0909_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林的賀年相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36f18f9ace66e336e18448f86af4c4fa/2025-03/LYNN_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林曾分享素顏捧花相，皮膚白滑零皺紋。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/448ef059c506769900740573b2247a21/2023-03/001sahxlgy1hb2yb6wy5dj61sc2ds4qq02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林大晒白滑長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/333c41ef9ba9279cb5e4d0f7134cbab1/2023-10/lynnx1010_1689305130_3146441947938101838_652653955.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林保養不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69d24bff6eae13da21bf159e7fc78a8c/2023-03/001sahxlgy1gz4vx8k0vwj616o1kw1kx02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林大晒曲線剪影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/925d7c4ce67fe9e359c29e93049f8623/2023-03/001sahxlgy1h5fg5i8wizj62542vrhdt02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林擁有一把烏黑長髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/087d71c2efef98b730dae49e57e132a7/2023-04/LYNN%20%283%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林拍片與網民分享養生之道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb736840ac48632ffef34c9e23d11178/2023-04/LYNN%20%281%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊黛林平日會飲紅豆湯及阿膠漿口服液。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60e19fed8b3a1e6c0e63f9bb97ab0694/2023-04/LYNN%20%285%29.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:25.490091+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":671,"images":42,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:43.556547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:38:51.923434+00:00","content_hash":"f5c354b9ee1248baaae415549f61b8cf93236a495033822f80c1171e42b2cc40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}